# ==========================================================================
# high-entropy-misc.txt
# ==========================================================================

# high-entropy-not-secret  (lines 1-2)
#   NEGATIVE CONTROL, and the sharpest one in the corpus. Two
#   maximum-entropy strings - a 64-character alphanumeric run and a base64
#   blob - that are not credentials for anything. leaky-repo's own
#   secrets.csv scores this file 0 risk and 2 informative. A tool scoring
#   purely on Shannon entropy cannot pass this case and clear the Rails
#   master.key case at the same time.
high-entropy-misc.txt:high-entropy-not-secrethigh-entropy-misc.txtsecretsfalse1-2

